<ProseLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Developer Business Lab refund policy for digital products, guides, workbooks, and bundles."
  eyebrow="Legal"
>
  <p>Developer Business Lab sells digital products, including downloadable guides, workbooks, and bundles. Because access is provided digitally, refunds are limited to the circumstances described below.</p>

  <h2>14-day refund window</h2>
  <p>If you purchase a Developer Business Lab product and believe it materially does not match the description on the product page, you may request a refund within 14 days of purchase.</p>
  <p>Refund requests are reviewed individually. If approved, the refund will be returned to the original payment method.</p>

  <h2>When refunds are not normally provided</h2>
  <p>We do not normally issue refunds because you changed your mind, no longer need the product, did not use it, or expected a result that was not promised on the product page.</p>
  <p>Developer Business Lab products are educational resources. They do not guarantee clients, revenue, business growth, or any other specific outcome.</p>

  <h2>Defective, incomplete, or inaccessible files</h2>
  <p>If a file is corrupted, incomplete, defective, or you have trouble accessing your purchase, contact us first. We will make reasonable efforts to provide a working copy or restore access. If we cannot do so, a refund may be issued.</p>

  <h2>Duplicate purchases</h2>
  <p>If the same customer accidentally purchases the same product more than once, we will refund the duplicate purchase when we can verify it.</p>

  <h2>Bundles</h2>
  <p>Refund requests for bundles are handled for the bundle as a whole. Individual products within a purchased bundle cannot be returned separately for a partial refund.</p>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>Submit your request within 14 days of purchase using the contact information provided with your order. Include the email address used for the purchase, your order number if available, the product purchased, and the reason for the request.</p>
  <p>Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method. Processing time after approval may depend on the payment provider.</p>
</ProseLayout>
